    "detailed_description": "Click the image below to play the free demo<br><br><br><br>A penny saved is a penny earned. And a penny spent on upgrades to get more pennies over time is the recipe for a dopamine-fueling incremental game.<br><br>In this physics-based incremental game, you drop coins into a jar. When 2 coins of the same type touch, they merge into the next-bigger coin and you earn points. Spend points on upgrades like a bigger jar to hold even more coins.<br><br>",
